# Development and test dependencies. Not installed in the Docker image.
#
# requirements-dev.txt is generated from this file with the same versions as
# requirements.txt for every package the two share (the -c line), so CI tests
# exactly what the image runs. Regenerate both with:
#
#     bash .github/scripts/lock-requirements.sh
-c requirements.txt
-r requirements.in

